{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/mondrian-beachfront-residence-elevate-al-marjan-island","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1217,"crm_id":"196","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Mondrian Beachfront Residence","slug":"mondrian-beachfront-residence-elevate-al-marjan-island","display_address":"Al Marjan Island","building_type":["apartment","townhouse","sky-villa"],"completion_year":"2028","developer":"Elevate","price":2500000,"display_price":"2.5M","lattitude":25.682575,"longitude":55.74544,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Mondrian Beachfront Residence is a luxurious residential destination located on the pristine shores of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.providentestate.com/area-guides/al-marjan-island/\">Al Marjan Island</a> in Ras Al Khaimah. Developed by Elevate, this project brings world-class living to the UAE with architecture by Gensler and interiors curated by the acclaimed Bergman Design House. It offers an elegant collection of 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments, townhouses, and exclusive sky villas—all complemented by 5-star hotel services.</p><p>Offering residents an unmatched coastal lifestyle, Mondrian Beachfront Residence at Al Marjan Island features private beach access and stunning sea views. With its refined design language, curated interiors, and resort-style comforts, it presents an iconic lifestyle destination. The project combines visionary architecture, renowned design, and premium amenities to deliver a one-of-a-kind residential experience in Ras Al Khaimah.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Mondrian_Beachfront_Residence_feature_c2e0b1c670.jpg","hash":"Mondrian_Beachfront_Residence_feature_c2e0b1c670","name":"Mondrian-Beachfront-Residence-feature.jpg"},"banner_